    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Moss Beach Distillery, opened 1927 as Frank’s Place, attracted bootleggers during Prohibition.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visithalfmoonbay.org/articles/moss-beach-california-nature-filled-getaway"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Fitzgerald Marine Reserve, a biodiverse intertidal area, lies just north of the distillery and offers tide pools with giant anemones and sunflower stars.",
